{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vending Machine Co.</strong>, a cozy fiddley management and job simulator game where you grow a vending machine business across a Japanese-inspired city full of life, charm, and opportunity. Filled with a lot of minigames!</p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/0b018bdf8a118af7acc94ea39ba44981.poster.avif?t=1752642454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/0b018bdf8a118af7acc94ea39ba44981.webm?t=1752642454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/0b018bdf8a118af7acc94ea39ba44981.mp4?t=1752642454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start small, with just a few machines and limited items. Choose your first neighborhood\u2014will you begin in the quiet streets of <i>Komorebi Homes</i> or the bustling pop culture paradise of <i>Otaku Alley</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the city map and unlock new districts, each with unique residents and preferences. From tired salarymen in the business district to curious tourists near temple grounds, everyone needs a snack, drink, or quirky gadget\u2014and you\u2019re here to deliver!</p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/23b90326c96f545498b0cc2ddc5fe636.poster.avif?t=1752642454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/23b90326c96f545498b0cc2ddc5fe636.webm?t=1752642454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/23b90326c96f545498b0cc2ddc5fe636.mp4?t=1752642454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Core Gameplay:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\uddfe Explore and unlock neighborhoods with different buyer types   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Install and upgrade vending machines across pre-set city spots   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\uded2 Buy wholesale items like ramen, gachapon toys, green tea, and gadgets   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udcb8 Set prices based on local demand and daily market trends   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udce6 Add machine features like drink heaters, coolers, and QR payments   </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83c\udfae Enjoy chill upgrades, cozy vibes, and satisfying sales flow   </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As your empire grows, so will your catalog. Stock seasonal goods, keep up with trends, and make each machine a perfect match for its area. </p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/289525123102ded8fad2b1f516e60e73.poster.avif?t=1752642454\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/289525123102ded8fad2b1f516e60e73.webm?t=1752642454\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/289525123102ded8fad2b1f516e60e73.mp4?t=1752642454\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you\u2019re optimizing profits or just vibing with the ambient lo-fi and cicadas, <strong>Vending Machine Co.</strong> lets you build your business at your own pace with different game modes that fit your preference! </p><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622640/extras/wishlist_vend.png?t=1752642454\" /></div>","